Concrete edits that can help improve a professional profile photo include adjusting the brightness and contrast to ensure your face is well-lit, cropping the photo to focus attention on your face, and using a slight filter to enhance the colors without overly altering the natural look of the image. Additionally, ensuring the background is not distracting and is relevant to your profession can also enhance the photo's effectiveness.

